 "verdict": "key consistent: 20r l.8-20v l.13 and 47r l.1-11 are one cipher in one alphabet and one key. 336 signs against 334 letters of the eight-verse riddle as enciphered; 26 shapes, 5 singletons; 325 of 329 repeated-shape occurrences take their majority letter (98.8%, skeleton 99.1%). The 20r-20v part alone (verses 1-5): 212 signs, 210 letters, 23 shapes, 206 of 207 repeated occurrences (99.5%, skeleton 100%). Against the record's wording of verses 1-5 the fit is 96.9%; the cipher departs from that wording in six places (notes).",
 "notes": [
  "Chain 20r.8 is the FIRST half of the riddle cipher whose second half is 47r.1 (quire 3 bound out of place: 20v runs on into 47r; identity_readings.md section 10). Its own record ran it on into 21r l.1-5 on length alone; 21r l.1-5 is a different block (see block_21r_1_5).",
  "Plaintext of verses 1-5 AS ENCIPHERED (by eye, 47r key): فما وليد ربا في شهر مولده وعاد فيه قديم السن قد نحلا / وما ثياب وقد خيطت بلا ابر وما ادير لها سلك ولا فتلا / وما فتى ان تهيا هيب جانبه ولا يهاب اذا في الملبس انتعلا / وما جبان لما عان في شرف ان ابطا ساعه مبناهما بطلا / وما مساكن ترتاح القلوب لها يريدها القوم قد كانت لهم حللا",
  "Where the cipher departs from the clear riddle as recorded (chains_0078_0101.jsonl 47r.1 whole_riddle_as_read): v1 مدخلا -> قد نحلا (cipher Q D | N KS L A, KS = ح as in 47r حتى; 'grown thin'); v2 قد خيطت -> وقد خيطت (an extra و: W Q D); v2 ادبرها [?] -> ادير لها (A D Y R | L H A); v3 تهيبا -> تهيا (no ب: Y A after T H); v4 ان لحظا اساعة [?] -> ان ابطا ساعه (A Bh | TT A A | S A AY H; the cipher writes ابطاا with a second alif, counted as a surplus sign); v4 جبان written with a second alif (V Bh A A N, surplus sign). The clear text of 47r l.13-47v l.4 was NOT re-read on the master here: these are the cipher's readings, to be checked against the clear text (several are probably record misreadings, as on 47r يستنفنه).",
  "Plain V (no hook) takes خ in خيطت and ج in جبان; ج is also written with an open ha-like hook J in جانبه. Same skeleton (ج/خ), so the skeleton consistency on 20r-20v is 100%.",
